{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778977719307,"sessionID":"ses_1ccaa8a51ffe66fcrNKIYLeG3y","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_s2TIArfrpJLxU70vMNq2xFas","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/docs/patterns/cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX.md","offset":1,"limit":220},"output":"<path>/__w/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/docs/patterns/cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX \n2: \n3: [http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX)\n4: ## Description \n5: \n6: A cell type that is characterized by a plasma membrane part, such as a cilium or receptor. Note - that this is only good for cells defined by a single plasma membrane receptor.\n7: ## Contributors \n8: * [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432](https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5208-3432) \n9: * [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165](https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165) \n10: ## Name \n11: \n12: {[cell](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000003)} {[plasma_membrane](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005886)}\n13: \n14: ## Annotations \n15: \n16: * [exact_synonym](http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym): {[cell](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000003)}-positive {[plasma_membrane](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005886)}\n17: \n18: ## Definition \n19: \n20: A {[cell](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000003)} that has a {[plasma_membrane](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005886)}.\n21: \n22: ## Equivalent to \n23: \n24: {[cell](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000003)} and ([has plasma membrane part](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002104) some {[plasma_membrane](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0005886)})\n25: \n\n(End of file - total 25 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX \n\n[http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/cellHasPlasmaMembranePartX](http://pur